        "TileImage": "$($repository 5b76b821-b4d5-42e7-a3ce-52bb5775614a).Image",
        "Description": "Good Day 47,\rThese four guards are planning a hunting trip but they can&#39;t decide which season it is.\rIs it Rabbit Season (Wabbit Season)?    OR\rIs it Duck Season?\rThis has escalated into a deadly argument and now they&#39;re all locked, loaded, and paranoid.\rSo the bank has hired you to terminate them and have asked you to wear the given disguises.\rMake it cartoonishly clean.\r\rGood Luck.\r\rBy - SW\r\n\r\n<HCCE>",
